{"id":"10.4.4","doc":"T","title":"Wakeup Source","words":442,"blocks":[{"t":"p","s":[{"n":1,"c":[{"t":"text","v":"The ESP32-S3 supports various wakeup sources, which could wake up the CPU in different sleep modes."}]},{"n":2,"c":[{"t":"text","v":"The wakeup source is determined by "},{"t":"field","v":"RTC_CNTL_RTC_WAKEUP_ENA"},{"t":"text","v":" as shown in Table 10.4-3."}]}]},{"t":"table","caption":"Table 10.4-3. Wakeup Source","head":[[{"t":"text","v":"WAKEUP_ENA"}],[{"t":"text","v":"Wakeup Source (note 10)"}],[{"t":"text","v":"Light-sleep"}],[{"t":"text","v":"Deep-sleep"}],[{"t":"text","v":"Note"}]],"rows":[{"n":3,"c":[[{"t":"text","v":"0x1"}],[{"t":"text","v":"EXT0"}],[{"t":"text","v":"Y"}],[{"t":"text","v":"Y"}],[{"t":"text","v":"1"}]]},{"n":4,"c":[[{"t":"text","v":"0x2"}],[{"t":"text","v":"EXT1"}],[{"t":"text","v":"Y"}],[{"t":"text","v":"Y"}],[{"t":"text","v":"2"}]]},{"n":5,"c":[[{"t":"text","v":"0x4"}],[{"t":"text","v":"GPIO"}],[{"t":"text","v":"Y"}],[{"t":"text","v":"Y"}],[{"t":"text","v":"3"}]]},{"n":6,"c":[[{"t":"text","v":"0x8"}],[{"t":"text","v":"RTC timer"}],[{"t":"text","v":"Y"}],[{"t":"text","v":"Y"}],[{"t":"text","v":"-"}]]},{"n":7,"c":[[{"t":"text","v":"0x20"}],[{"t":"block","v":"Wi-Fi","id":"wifi"}],[{"t":"text","v":"Y"}],[{"t":"text","v":"-"}],[{"t":"text","v":"4"}]]},{"n":8,"c":[[{"t":"text","v":"0x40"}],[{"t":"block","v":"UART0","id":"uart"}],[{"t":"text","v":"Y"}],[{"t":"text","v":"-"}],[{"t":"text","v":"5"}]]},{"n":9,"c":[[{"t":"text","v":"0x80"}],[{"t":"text","v":"UART1"}],[{"t":"text","v":"Y"}],[{"t":"text","v":"-"}],[{"t":"text","v":"5"}]]},{"n":10,"c":[[{"t":"text","v":"0x100"}],[{"t":"text","v":"TOUCH Active"}],[{"t":"text","v":"Y"}],[{"t":"text","v":"Y"}],[{"t":"text","v":"6"}]]},{"n":11,"c":[[{"t":"text","v":"0x200"}],[{"t":"block","v":"ULP-FSM","id":"ulp"}],[{"t":"text","v":"Y"}],[{"t":"text","v":"Y"}],[{"t":"text","v":"7"}]]},{"n":12,"c":[[{"t":"text","v":"0x400"}],[{"t":"text","v":"BT"}],[{"t":"text","v":"Y"}],[{"t":"text","v":"-"}],[{"t":"text","v":"4"}]]},{"n":13,"c":[[{"t":"text","v":"0x800"}],[{"t":"text","v":"ULP-RISC-V"}],[{"t":"text","v":"Y"}],[{"t":"text","v":"Y"}],[]]},{"n":14,"c":[[{"t":"text","v":"0x1000"}],[{"t":"text","v":"XTAL_32K"}],[{"t":"text","v":"Y"}],[{"t":"text","v":"Y"}],[{"t":"text","v":"8"}]]},{"n":15,"c":[[{"t":"text","v":"0x2000"}],[{"t":"text","v":"ULP-RISC-V Trap"}],[{"t":"text","v":"Y"}],[{"t":"text","v":"Y"}],[{"t":"text","v":"9"}]]},{"n":16,"c":[[{"t":"text","v":"0x8000"}],[{"t":"text","v":"TOUCH Timeout"}],[{"t":"text","v":"Y"}],[{"t":"text","v":"Y"}],[{"t":"text","v":"-"}]]},{"n":17,"c":[[{"t":"text","v":"0xc000"}],[{"t":"text","v":"BROWNOUT"}],[{"t":"text","v":"Y"}],[{"t":"text","v":"Y"}],[{"t":"text","v":"-"}]]}]},{"t":"p","s":[{"n":18,"c":[{"t":"b","c":[{"t":"text","v":"Note:"}]}],"warn":true}]},{"t":"list","ordered":true,"items":[[{"t":"p","s":[{"n":19,"c":[{"t":"text","v":"EXT0 can only wake up the chip from Light-sleep/Deep-sleep modes."}]},{"n":20,"c":[{"t":"text","v":"If "},{"t":"field","v":"RTC_CNTL_EXT_WAKEUP0_LV"},{"t":"text","v":" is 1, it's triggered when the pin level is high."}]},{"n":21,"c":[{"t":"text","v":"Otherwise, it's triggered when the pin level is low."}]},{"n":22,"c":[{"t":"text","v":"Users can configure RTCIO_EXT_WAKEUP0_SEL to select an RTC pin as a wakeup source."}]}]}],[{"t":"p","s":[{"n":23,"c":[{"t":"text","v":"EXT1 is especially designed to wake up the chip from any sleep modes, and can be triggered by a combination of pins."}]},{"n":24,"c":[{"t":"text","v":"Users should define the combination of wakeup sources by configuring "},{"t":"field","v":"RTC_CNTL_EXT_WAKEUP1_SEL"},{"t":"text","v":"[17:0] according to the bitmap of selected wakeup source."}]},{"n":25,"c":[{"t":"text","v":"When "},{"t":"field","v":"RTC_CNTL_EXT_WAKEUP1_LV"},{"t":"text","v":" == 1, the chip is waken up if any pin in the combination is high level."}]},{"n":26,"c":[{"t":"text","v":"When "},{"t":"field","v":"RTC_CNTL_EXT_WAKEUP1_LV"},{"t":"text","v":" == 0, the chip is only waken up if any pins in the combination is low level."}]},{"n":27,"c":[{"t":"text","v":"Note that the EXT1 hold time should be longer than three RTC slow clock cycles, otherwise the signal status will not be captured in "},{"t":"field","v":"RTC_CNTL_EXT_WAKEUP1_STATUS"},{"t":"text","v":"."}]}]}],[{"t":"p","s":[{"n":28,"c":[{"t":"text","v":"In Deep-sleep mode, only the RTC GPIOs (not regular GPIOs) can work as a wakeup source."}]}]}],[{"t":"p","s":[{"n":29,"c":[{"t":"text","v":"To wake up the chip with a Wi-Fi or BT source, the chip switches between the Active, Modem-sleep, and Light-sleep modes."}]},{"n":30,"c":[{"t":"text","v":"The CPU and radio are woken up at predetermined intervals to keep Wi-Fi/BT connections active."}]}]}],[{"t":"p","s":[{"n":31,"c":[{"t":"text","v":"A wakeup is triggered when the number of RX pulses received exceeds the setting in the threshold register."}]}]}],[{"t":"p","s":[{"n":32,"c":[{"t":"text","v":"A wakeup is triggered when any touch event is detected by the "},{"t":"block","v":"touch sensor","id":"touch"},{"t":"text","v":"."}]}]}],[{"t":"p","s":[{"n":33,"c":[{"t":"text","v":"A wakeup is triggered when "},{"t":"field","v":"RTC_CNTL_RTC_SW_CPU_INT"},{"t":"text","v":" is configured by the ULP co-processor."}]}]}],[{"t":"p","s":[{"n":34,"c":[{"t":"text","v":"When the "},{"t":"num","v":"32 kHz","k":"frequency"},{"t":"text","v":" crystal is working as RTC slow clock, a wakeup is triggered upon any detection of any crystal stops by the "},{"t":"num","v":"32 kHz","k":"frequency"},{"t":"text","v":" watchdog timer."}]}]}],[{"t":"p","s":[{"n":35,"c":[{"t":"text","v":"A wakeup is triggered when the ULP co-processor starts capturing exceptions (e.g., stack overflow)."}]}]}],[{"t":"p","s":[{"n":36,"c":[{"t":"text","v":"All wakeup sources can also be configured as the causes to reject sleep, except UART."}]}]}]]}]}